The wiki did not explain the resistant creature thing very well.
Mjollnir is not as exciting later on because some of the really
powerful creatures are resistant to just about everything.  In other
words, most of the powerful monsters that are resistant to lightning
are also resistant to cold.

The most annoying monster in Gehennom is the arch-lich, which is
resistant to both lightning and cold.  It also doesn't take silver
damage, so a silver saber wouldn't help much either.  However, the
other liches do take lightning damage, and it is important to note
that the master lich is resistant to cold, but does take lightning
damage

Also, none of the weapons are exciting against the powerful monsters
on the Astral Plane.


